@startuml
title file!readLine(buf) — end to end;  status reply = happens-before
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
actor Client #4F82C2
participant "File agent" as File #3C9C9C
participant "Buffer agent" as Buf #5FA75F

Client -> File : file!readLine(buf)
activate File
loop until newline, buffer full, or EOF
  File -> File : read chunk at current position
  File -> Buf : buf!writeBytes(chunk)
  activate Buf
  Buf --> File : [true, nWritten]
  deactivate Buf
end
File --> Client : [true, nRead, flags]  (flags: eof, truncated)
deactivate File
note over Client, Buf
buf handle is unchanged and still valid.
Client reads buf ONLY inside the success
continuation — the reply is the happens-before edge.
end note
@enduml
